# Serve the SPA shell for the dedicated admin panel path (the app's router
# takes over from there and enforces the server-side admin gate).
# NOTE: /adminpanel is unusable — a dashboard-level 308 redirect hijacks that
# prefix (outside this repo). The panel lives at /manage instead.
# NOTE 2 (2026-10-15): the rewrite target MUST be `/`, never `/index.html`.
# A dashboard-level 308 (`/index.html -> /`, added for SEO extensionless URLs)
# breaks any 200-rewrite whose target is /index.html — the /manage/* rule
# silently stopped serving the app shell and returned the 404 page instead.
# This also explains the old "bare exact 200-rewrite inexplicably 308s" note.
/manage / 200
/manage/* / 200

# Teacher portal: clean URL for the teacher landing + workspace (the app's
# router takes over from the path, same pattern as /manage).
/teachers / 200
/teachers/* / 200

